  step,dige:2343a48d4f4a8651
  step=2,desc:stand four looped pairs with P nine turns ahead of Q — two with a lag on the wire back — and wake each as asked,dige:61375936b017dc5b
  step=3,desc:12 clock pulses each — each pair woken in its asked order,dige:cfb3c1648782fe01
  step=4,desc:8 clock pulses each — each pair woken in its asked order,dige:b84b043ae5834049
    Assertion:a-loop-of-wires,sentence:a loop of wires leaks which tank was asked to wake first — the two pairs come out different
    Assertion:a-lag-on-one,sentence:a lag on one wire of the loop breaks it — asked either way the pair comes out the same
    Assertion:each-tank-on-a,sentence:each tank on a loop with no lag is told so — a TheALoop row names the loop — and a loop with a lag says nothing
    Assertion:the-first-two-fish,sentence:the first two fish go round the loop — at turn 30 they wait on the lagged wire back into the tank they hatched in — older than any fish there
